# Files that are not website content. Cloudflare's static-asset deploy reads
# this file and does not upload what it matches (gitignore syntax). GitHub
# Pages ignores it, so the preview is unaffected; it matters at the Cloudflare
# launch. Without it the whole repo would be public on the business domain --
# exactly what happened on NEXUS (found 2026-10-12).
.assetsignore
.claude
.git
.github
.gitignore
.nojekyll
*.md
*.py
*.pyc
__pycache__
images/.derivatives
local_research.json
